              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new run of words: what did dard mean, and what did bukhār mean?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: अब",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अब (ab) — \"now, from this point on\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The dictionaries do not agree on where अब (ab) came from, and this book will say so rather than invent a chain. What it does is clear enough, and that is worth more here than a pedigree."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अब draws a line: everything before it was one way, and from here on things are another. That is what separates it from अभी, which you already own — अभी is this very second, अब is from this second onward. ab and abhī look alike and do different work."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The first of five words of degree and pace."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "ab",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *ab*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "it once more, slowly",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: it once more, slowly]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
